{
  "description": "自定义翻译服务的请求构造用例，权威实现是 crates/client-core/src/translation.rs 的 custom_translation_request。主机名恰好是 api.deepl.com 或 api-free.deepl.com（https、默认端口）的地址按 DeepL 官方 API 构造：DeepL-Auth-Key 鉴权、text 为数组、target_lang 用 ZH-HANS / EN-US，主机按密钥是否以 :fx 结尾选择，路径固定为 /v2/translate；没有密钥时不发请求（request 为 null）。其他地址按 DeepLX 兼容格式原样构造。endpoint 与 api_key 已去掉首尾空白并通过各宿主的地址校验。Linux provider（tests/dictionary/custom_translation_contract.py）逐条核对这里的全部用例；只放各平台 URL 解析器结论一致的写法。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "DeepLX 带密钥",
      "endpoint": "https://deeplx.example/translate", "api_key": "synthetic-key",
      "text": "测试", "source_language": "zh", "target_language": "en",
      "request": {
        "url": "https://deeplx.example/translate",
        "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json", "Authorization": "Bearer synthetic-key" },
        "body": { "text": "测试", "source_lang": "ZH", "target_lang": "EN" }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "DeepLX 不带密钥",
      "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:1188/translate", "api_key": "",
      "text": "hello", "source_language": "en", "target_language": "zh",
      "request": {
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:1188/translate",
        "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
        "body": { "text": "hello", "source_lang": "EN", "target_lang": "ZH" }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "自建服务的 /v2/translate 路径仍按 DeepLX",
      "endpoint": "https://deeplx.example/v2/translate", "api_key": "synthetic-key",
      "text": "测试", "source_language": "zh", "target_language": "fr",
      "request": {
        "url": "https://deeplx.example/v2/translate",
        "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json", "Authorization": "Bearer synthetic-key" },
        "body": { "text": "测试", "source_lang": "ZH", "target_lang": "FR" }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "DeepL Free",
      "endpoint": "https://api-free.deepl.com/v2/translate", "api_key": "synthetic-key:fx",
      "text": "hello", "source_language": "en", "target_language": "zh",
      "request": {
        "url": "https://api-free.deepl.com/v2/translate",
        "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json", "Authorization": "DeepL-Auth-Key synthetic-key:fx" },
        "body": { "text": ["hello"], "source_lang": "EN", "target_lang": "ZH-HANS" }
      }
    },
